  "question": "A bar magnet has moment of inertia $49 \\times 10^{-2}\\ \\text{kg m}^2$ and vibrates in a magnetic field of induction $0.5 \\times 10^{-4}$ T. The time period of vibration is $8.8$ s. The magnetic moment of the bar magnet is",
